      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 20,
      "text": "Though, appeal is filed in 2017, same has not progressed beyond compliance of office objections, for which, it was listed innumerable times, dismissed for non-prosecution and restored on cost.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 2504,
      "end": 2697,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 21,
      "text": "However, there is neither compliance nor cost paid.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 2698,
      "end": 2750,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 22,
      "text": "This would indicate that appellants are not pursuing appeal diligently.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
